<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Xin chào</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f8ff;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
    }

    .hello {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 60px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    h1 {
      color: #1d4ed8;
      font-size: 42px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    p {
      color: #333;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="hello">
    <h1>Xin chào!</h1>
    <p>Chào mừng bạn đã đến với trang web của chúng tôi.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

